-- =====================================================================================================================
-- A34 WINNER REPLACEMENT: LEGACY FINANCE CASE BLOCKER + OLDEST-DEBT-FIRST ORDER (Worker BT "legacy-case-blocker",
-- 27 Sep 2026). Built by workers/legacy_case/gen_a34.py from the INSTALLED claude_h0_combined definitions (A2-A33)
